<title>BRAZIL: BRAZIL'S CENTRAL BANK BUYS DOLLARS AT 1.0850.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL'S CENTRAL BANK BUYS DOLLARS AT 1.0850.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank bought dollars at 1.0850 reais per greenback in a buy tender in the commercial foreign exchange market, dealers said.</p>
<p>((-- Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5418))</p>
